  "portal_summary": "Red Hat OpenShift Container Platform release 4.9.0 is now available with updates to packages and images that fix several bugs and add enhancements.\n\nRed Hat Product Security has rated this update as having a security impact of Moderate. A Common Vulnerability Scoring System (CVSS) base score, which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVE link(s) in the References section.",
